Your turn






NoteExercise



Under high moisture, the data include four irrigation methods. Which one had the most disease over the whole season?








TipAnswer






PowderyMildew |&gt;
  filter(moisture == "High moisture") |&gt;
  group_by(irrigation_type, time) |&gt;
  summarise(sev = mean(sev), .groups = "drop") |&gt;
  group_by(irrigation_type) |&gt;
  summarise(audpc = AUDPC(time = time, y = sev, y_proportion = TRUE)) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(audpc))

# A tibble: 4 × 2
  irrigation_type audpc
  &lt;fct&gt;           &lt;dbl&gt;
1 Drip            13.4 
2 MS               8.68
3 MS above canopy  4.09
4 Overhead         3.71
